# n8n + Jarvis

- Prefer existing Jarvis voice/router hooks: say or route `trigger n8n <webhook-path>`.
- Webhooks hit `{n8n_url}/webhook/<path>` with JSON `{"source":"jarvis", ...}`.
- Credentials live in `config/settings.json` (`n8n_url`, `n8n_api_key`) — never commit real keys.
- n8n is **not** in Cursor MCP by default (removed — local token hassle). Voice/webhook path above still works. See `docs/HANDOVER_MCP.md` for current MCP set (Buffer, Gmail, Stripe, Notion).
- Keep heavy workflows async (Jarvis task queue) so the voice loop stays free.
